        "recommended_treatment": "Wash daily with a gentle Salicylic Acid (BHA) cleanser to unclog pores. Apply a topical retinoid (like Adapalene gel) at night to speed up cell turnover. Use a lightweight, non-comedogenic moisturizer to prevent the skin from overproducing oil."
