        "severity": "Mild",
        "recommended_treatment": "Wash with a gentle cleanser to prep the skin. Apply a Vitamin C or Alpha Arbutin serum in the morning to actively brighten dark spots. Apply a broad-spectrum SPF 30+ sunscreen every day."
      },
