        "recommended_treatment": "Cleanse with an ultra-gentle, hydrating face wash. Apply an OTC Azelaic Acid serum to help reduce inflammation and diffuse redness. Protect the skin daily with a mineral sunscreen (Zinc Oxide/Titanium Dioxide) to block UV triggers."
